<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_games",
    "Hex Solitaire is Klondike, the classic game of patience, for one player. Put every card on the four piles at the top, each from the ace up to the king, using the seven columns of the table and the deck. Nobody plays against you: your score is your own, and your best games go into the ranking."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_btn_keyboard}>{dgettext("help_games", "Controls")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("help_games", "Tap a card")}</strong> {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "— Move it to its place: a pile at the top first, otherwise the first column that takes it"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("help_games", "Drag")}</strong> {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "— Move a card, or the cards on top of it, onto another pile"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("help_games", "Tap the deck")}</strong> {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "— Draw its next card, or start the deck again when it is empty"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("help_games", "Tap the deck before you play")}</strong> {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "— Choose another back for the cards"
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_games", "Rules")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "On the table, a card goes on one a rank higher of the other colour: a red six on a black seven."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Only a king, with the cards on top of it, goes into an empty column."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "A face-down card turns over by itself once nothing lies on it."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Hex Solitaire draws one card at a time from the deck. Hex Solitaire: Draw Three draws three, and only the top one can be played."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "When nothing is left hidden, the cards go up to the piles at the top by themselves."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_games", "Score")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "A card on a pile at the top is worth 10 points; a card from the deck onto the table, or a card turned over, 5."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Taking a card back from a pile at the top costs 15 points. Starting the deck again costs 100 points drawing one card, 20 drawing three."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Every ten seconds of play cost 2 points. A win earns a time bonus: the faster, the bigger."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "The End button keeps the points you have. A game still open after an hour ends by itself."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_joystick}>{dgettext("help_games", "Inspiration")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_games",
    "Klondike is a card game from the nineteenth century, made famous on the PC by the solitaire that came with Windows."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_games", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-retro-games">{dgettext("help_games", "Retro Games")}</.help_link>
</p>
